So topic modelling is an example of unsupervised machine learning, so not machine learning

01:03:50.460 --> 01:03:56.820
where we have a label on the document, and we're trying to predict.

01:03:56.820 --> 01:03:59.160
You know, we're not trying to predict yes, no.

01:03:59.160 --> 01:04:03.400
Instead, we don't have any labels and instead we're doing unsupervised machine learning

01:04:03.400 --> 01:04:04.400
here.

01:04:04.400 --> 01:04:07.380
So that's the kind of model that topic modelling is.

