We can make a representation with embedding, and then use that, like take the flavor, the representation, and then use that to train a logistic regression model.

01:53:50.908 --> 01:53:56.908
Once you have the representation, then you have many, many, many options of things you can do,

01:53:56.908 --> 01:54:07.908
but the traditional dimensionality reduction works more poorly on text than these because they're built specifically for this application.

